              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Permissionless graduation, one step per call (Soroban bounds the ledger entries a transaction may touch).\\nEach call performs the NEXT step and returns the step reached; the last one returns `Graduated`:\\n1. `PoolCreated`: pulls the Aquarius creation fee (live from the router, in AQUA) from `payer`, creates the\\nstandard 30 bps pool, seeds it with all raised quote and `lp_supply`, burns the LP shares and the unsold\\ncurve tokens. Trading is closed from here on. Only this step needs `payer`'s signature; later steps\\nignore it. Unspent fee (pool already existed) is refunded to `payer`.\\n2. `GroupCreated`: `market_factory.create_group(owner = this curve, name = token symbol)`.\\n3. `QuoteMarketAdded`, 4. `QuoteMarketActivated`: the quote asset market.\\n5. `TokenMarketAdded`, 6. `Graduated`: the token market priced from the pool (`AquariusOnly`).\\nReverts `NotGraduatable` before the target, `AlreadyGraduated` after the last step.",
      "name": "graduate",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "payer",
          "type_": "address"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "GradStep"
              }
            },
            "error_type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "CurveError"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
